<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 YOANI</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Yoa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Yoani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Yoani</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 Yoani</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Yenebi'li' ya Yoani</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua yenebi'li' ya Yoani yaandikilwe na Ntumilwe Yoani mumwaka 90 bu'ka po belekwa Yesu Kilisitu. Yoani abayali mwene panga nga mwandiki lakini paali pake aikema nng'oi. Makowe gagabile nkati ya balua 2 Yoani galandana muno kati galu' gagabile nkati ya Injili kati mwaiandikilwe na Yoani. Yi'no ibonekana mpu'la muno palu' pakong'ondelya amuli ya Yesu yo pendana na mwalu' mwali'nganisa kumpenda Yesu na kwikoteya amuli yake. Iu'bi'li'ka panga Yoani aandike Injili kati mwaiandikilwe na Yoani pamope na balua yake itatu yani 1 Yoani, 2 Yoani na 3 Yoani nsimu paabile katama kumuyi wa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yoani aandike balua yi'no kwa mau' ywasaulilwe pamope na bana bake. Kwa mayi'gi'yo go aai kalombolya kanisa. Bu'kapo ngabaya balua yo yaai kwa kitumbu sa aumini boti. Libinio lya Yoani lyo andika balua yi'no lyabile lya kuliyi'ya mwoyo kanisa na kulipanga kanisa liili'ndi'le, bu'kana na iyogoyo ya balimu ba ubu'su'.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yoani ailaya balua yake no awanikia baapelekya nga kinyai, bu'kapo endakunsalimia <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Alisopa kanisa na kwaku'mbu'ki'ya bu'kana na amuli yaibile ngu'lu' kulikoni yoti <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">1:4-6</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Aakwi'li'ka baili'ndi'le na balimu ba ubu'su' <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">1:7-11</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Yoani ayomolya balua kwo piya salamu ya kwalaga <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">1:12-13</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Nenga na mpi'ndo wa kanisa, nikuandikya wenga wa mau' wausaulilwe na Nnu'ngu', pamope na bana bako. Nenga kakape nimpendile, na kwenda nenga baili, ila na bi'ngi' boti babaitangite yi'lu' kweli. <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />Nimpendile kwa kitumbu sa wu'lu' ukweli wautama nkati yitu, nawembe upala tama pamope na twenga milele.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Ngu'ngu', kiya na amani yaibu'ka kwa Tati' Nnu'ngu' na kwa Yesu Kilisitu Mwana wa Tati', ilu'a baa pamope na twenga muukweli na upendo.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukweli na upendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Naatipulaika muno kwabona bi'ngi' ba bana bako kabatama muukweli, kati mwabatuamulise Tati'. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Na nambi'yambi' mau' nendakunnu'ba panga, tupendane, na yi'no kwenda amuli yaayambi' lili, ila nga amuli yi'yi'lu'yi'lu' ya twaabile nayo bu'ka tokyaa. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Na wu'no nga upendo, tutame kwo kota amuli ya Nnu'ngu', na yi'no nga yi'lu' amuli, yamwaaiyu'wine bu'ka tokyaa panga, mupalikwa mwaboti tama muupendo.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Kwa mwanjaa abu'su' baingi bapitike padunia, bandu babakotoka yi'ki'tya panga Yesu Kilisitu aaisi kiyi'ga. Mundu ywoywoti ywabaya nyo, aywo nga mmu'su' kai' nga nndumu wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Bai, mwilinguli mwabene li'nga kanemuobeye si'lu' samuyomwike kukipangya kasi, ila mupate upo yinu yaitimilike.<verse eid="2JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Mundu ywoywoti ywakotoka tama nkati ya mayi'gano ga Kilisitu, ywembe ywo ntu'pu' Nnu'ngu'. Lakini ywayendelya kugakamwa mayi'gano ga Kilisitu, aywo abile na Tati' Nnu'ngu', kai' na Mwana wake. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Bai, mana kubile na mundu ywoywoti ywaisa kasinu kakotoka kunnetya mayi'gano go, kanemunkemi munyumba yinu na wala kanemumpange abali. <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Mwanjaa ywampanga abali mundu ywo, apanga kiselele nakwe mumakowe gake malau.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Nibile nago gambone gakummakia, lakini ngani tumya kalatasi na bwino. Paali pake nipala isa kasinu no longela namwenga katulolana, li'nga pulaa yitu ipate timilika. <verse eid="2JN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Bana ba nku'go muimani ywasaulilwe na Nnu'ngu', bendakusalimia.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>